    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "UNITED\nOur Friendly Times\nApril 24, 1977\nCN Tower, Toronto",
      "HONOLULU TIME\nOAKLAND\nMONTEREY\nSALINAS\nHONOLULU\nPACIFIC TIME\nVANCOUVER. B.C\nSEATTLE TACOMA\nSPOKANE\nPORTLAND\nPENDLETON-\nSALEM\nBOISE\nMEDFORD\n3KS\n/ RENO\n/ SACRAMENTO\nSTOCKTON\nMODESTO\nMERCED\nFRESNO\nVISALIA\n→ BAKERSFIELD\nSANTA BARBARA\nLOS ANGELES\nSAN DIEGO\nHOUNTAMTRE\n•SALT LAKE CITY\nDENVER\n/ LAS VEGAS\n• Location served by United Airlines and Western International Hotels\n• Location served by United Airlines\nL\nCENTRAL TIME\nEASTERN TIME\nMINNEAPOLIS ST. PAUL\nDES MOINES O\nOMAHA\nLINCOLN\nKANSAS CITY\nBOSTON\nMIDLAND\nSPRINGHELD\nPROVIDENCE\nMILWAUKEE\nALLENTOWN\nSOUTH BEND O\nFORT WAYNE\nYOUNGSTOWN\nRYANKEY\nNEW YORK\nNEWAKK\nOUTTARROR\nROCK ISLAND\nDAVENPORT\nDAYTON •\nCANTON\nBALTIMORE WASHINGTON\nCHARLESTON, W. VA\nNEWPORT NEWS\nWILLIAMSBURG\nRICHMOND\nNORFOLK PORTSMOUTH\nSOLENORORS\nWINSTON\nBRISTOL KINGSPORT JOHNSON CITY •\nKNOXVILLE\nRALEIGH\nDURHAM\n- CHARLOTTE\nMEMPHIS •\nHUNTSVILLE (\nASSASSA\nBIRMINGHAM\nNEW ORLEANS\nTAMPA\nST. PETERSBURG\nCLEARWATER\nWEST PALM BEACH\nMIAMI-\nFORT LAUDERDALE\nStandard route lines have been replaced by\nindications of general traffic flows on United\nAirlines. All cities served by United are\nportrayed.\nRev. 10/75"
